      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-11422-11569" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <p><seg source="#source-11457-11460">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11460-11481"><rb>弓張</rb><rt>ゆみは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11481-11484">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11484-11499"><rb>月</rb><rt>づき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11499-11504">の</seg></p>
